SECTION  id=s2  kind=features  layout=list  tone=quiet
TEXT sec=s2 slot=eyebrow text="Rehab without contracts."
TEXT sec=s2 slot=title text="What we do"
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Hamstring strains" body="We treat tears and pulls with manual therapy, four sessions over six weeks at 10am or 4pm."
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Post-op knee recovery" body="Return to running in eight weeks using gait analysis software, custom orthotics made from carbon fibre plates."
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Ankle sprains" body="We stabilise ligaments with proprioceptive drills and compression bandaging applied for twenty minutes daily until swelling subsides completely."
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Shoulder impingement" body="Pain-free overhead motion in six weeks through scapular stabilization exercises prescribed by a physiotherapist every other Tuesday morning."
SECTION  id=s3  kind=detail  layout=split  tone=quiet
TEXT sec=s3 slot=eyebrow text="The Kestrel difference"
TEXT sec=s3 slot=title text="Rehab [without] contracts."
TEXT sec=s3 slot=lede text="While other clinics bundle recovery with gym memberships, we provide a standalone treatment plan focused purely on manual therapy and gait analysis. Our carbon fibre orthotics are custom-moulded in the clinic rather than sourced from generic suppliers, ensuring your foot mechanics match exactly what you need for running."
ACTION sec=s3 slot=primary label="Custom orthotic trial" href="#contact"
MEDIA sec=s3 slot=figure motif=specimen
SECTION  id=s4  kind=roster  layout=stack  tone=bold
TEXT sec=s4 slot=eyebrow text="Meet your team"
TEXT sec=s4 slot=title text="Your practitioners"
ITEM sec=s4 slot=item title="Manual therapy specialist" body="Specialises in soft tissue tears and muscle pulls for runners, cyclists, and triathletes."
ITEM sec=s4 slot=item title="Gait analysis expert" body="Uses motion capture software to correct running form and designs custom orthotics for post-op knee recovery."
SECTION  id=s5  kind=faq  layout=stack  tone=quiet
TEXT sec=s5 slot=eyebrow text="Rehab without contracts"
TEXT sec=s5 slot=title text="Common questions"
ITEM sec=s5 slot=item title="How long does a treatment plan last?" body="Most clients commit to four weekly sessions over six weeks, with follow-up gait analysis software scans at week three and eight. If you cannot attend the full course due to work or travel, we can adjust your schedule without penalty."
ITEM sec=s5 slot=item title="Do I need a gym membership for recovery?" body="No — our manual therapy sessions are standalone treatments that do not require gym access. You will receive custom orthotics designed from carbon fibre plates in the clinic itself, which you wear during daily activities outside of treatment hours."
ITEM sec=s5 slot=item title="What happens if I miss a session?" body="Missing one week does not cancel your remaining appointments; we simply reschedule to maintain momentum toward your eight-week return-to-running goal. If gaps exceed two weeks, we may need to restart certain gait analysis protocols for safety."
ITEM sec=s5 slot=item title="Can I bring my sports coach to assessments?" body="Yes — we welcome coaches and athletes at every stage, including post-op knee recovery phases where motion capture software helps align training loads. Your physiotherapist will review your coaching notes alongside gait analysis data before prescribing new exercises."
SECTION  id=s6  kind=cta  layout=stack  tone=quiet
TEXT sec=s6 slot=title text="Your eight-week return"
TEXT sec=s6 slot=lede text="First session includes gait analysis software scans and custom orthotics design; final assessment confirms your clearance to run."
ACTION sec=s6 slot=primary label="Start treatment plan" href="#contact"
